<title>USA: TABLE - Savannah Foods Q3 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Savannah Foods Q3 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	     Three Quarters Ended</p>
<p>		  June 29,    June 30,	 June 29,    June 30,</p>
<p>		    1997	  1996	     1997	  1996</p>
<p>Net sales    $303,546    $287,462	 $883,156    $842,675</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>extraordinary item</p>
<p>		   11,402	 4,726	   29,379	 6,226</p>
<p>Extraordinary item,</p>
<p> net of tax     (376)	 (698)	    (376)	 (698)</p>
<p>Net income   $ 11,026    $  4,028	 $ 29,003    $  5,528</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p>Income before extraordinary item</p>
<p>		 $   0.43    $   0.18	 $   1.12    $   0.24</p>
<p>Extraordinary item</p>
<p>		   (0.01)	(0.03)	   (0.01)	(0.03)</p>
<p> Net income  $   0.42    $   0.15	 $   1.11    $   0.21</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>	     26,238,196  26,238,196     26,238,196  26,238,196</p>
<p>(Amounts in thousands except for shares and per share)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Savannah Foods &amp; Industries Inc its third quarter period ended June 29.</p>
<p>The company said its proposed merger with Florida Crystals Inc will have current annual revenues on a pro-forma basis of approximately $1.5 billion and will initially dilute its earnings.</p>
<p>Extraordinary items were incurred on the prepayment of long-term debt.</p>
